                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Here are the car rental companies available in Los Angeles along with their ratings and prices for a 3-day rental:\n\n1. **SunSet Rent-A-Car**\n   - **Rating**: 4.5\n   - **Available Cars**: Sedan, SUV, Convertible (does not list electric cars specifically)\n   - **Price for 3 days**: $135.00 (3 days x $45.00 per day)\n\n2. **Speedy Rentals**\n   - **Rating**: 4.5\n   - **Available Cars**: Sedan, Convertible (does not list electric cars specifically)\n   - **Price for 3 days**: $144.00 (3 days x $48.00 per day)\n\n3. **LAX Car Rental**\n   - **Rating**: 4.1\n   - **Available Cars**: Sedan, SUV, Truck (does not list electric cars specifically)\n   - **Price for 3 days**: $119.97 (3 days x $39.99 per day)\n\n### Recommendations:\n- **For your family**: You can choose either **SunSet Rent-A-Car** or **Speedy Rentals**, both have the same rating. However, **SunSet Rent-A-Car** has a wider range of vehicle types including SUVs.\n- **For your cousin's family**: **SunSet Rent-A-Car** or **LAX Car Rental** would be suitable as both offer SUVs, but **SunSet Rent-A-Car** has a higher rating.\n\nLet me know if you need further assistance or want to make reservations!"
